catflow 0.8
1. Read Audio   all-hands.m4a
2. Transcribe   Whisper Large v3; lang=en
3. <parallel three_reads>   text -> [text, text, text]
     1. Summarize   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Decisions made, one per line"

     2. Summarize   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Action items: owner — task —
                                deadline"
     3. Rewrite                 Ministral 3B; "as a markdown checklist"

     4. Summarize   (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; "Risks and open questions raised"
4. Merge        Qwen3 8B; "One minutes document, three sections:
                Decisions, Action Items, Risks"
5. Save Text    minutes.md
